      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "db9bbafc849195dba8e41e2776483acb08eeb5f1e1ec2783f096e1c809baf3c2:000001_-2181412930684974612:g0:r13",
      "row_index_0based": 13,
      "serialized_row_index": 13,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "主人公",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "わあ！？　が、ガウミィさん！？\n急にどうしたんですか！？　あと、その言い方、\n僕が色々と勘違いされますから！"
      ],
      "speaker": "主人公",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "cf7b7a9faa71f8cff7de6a149a3d12b55c244091ed82875ad18f0e4f262066b2",
